  "description": "“Wedding Cake Monogram” – Decorative Serif Font\nAdd a touch of sweet celebration to your creative projects with “Wedding Cake Monogram.” This unique decorative font features elegant serif characters framed by a whimsical circular border, complete with a charming tiered wedding cake and heart accents. Personalized monogrammed invitations, save-the-dates, and “thank you” cards. It is the perfect choice for personalized wedding decor and romantic branding.",
